    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d447">

                <pb facs="0551" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg477"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.7161</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 14, 1918</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received January 16, 2.34 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2231. Diplomatic Corps with unanimity and emphasis decided to demand immediate
                    release of Diamandi without discussing
                    causes of arrest, and to make such demand of Lenin. Diplomatic Corps on my suggestion going in body to visit
                        Lenin with whom I am endeavoring to
                    make engagement. Meeting attended by every chief of mission, including Spain,
                    Sweden, Norway, Denmark, Holland.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
